  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORCAP Strategic Humanitarian Partnership/Cash</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of humanitarian personell on short notice to the United Nation and other organisations strengthening their capacity to efficiently protect lives and livelihood of affected populations in crisis. 

CashCap: Advance the cash agenda, support local leadership in cash coordination and quality cash delivery to realise the unfulfilled potential CVA has in humanitarian responses. working with key sectors, including protection, gender and gender-based violence, where CashCap is having a crucial role. Cash based interventions enable crisis affected people to make choices and prioritise their own needs, including food needs. They also support markets critical to survival and recovery of communities.</narrative>
  </description>
